@startuml TimelineEditorMobileState
title Dionysus Timeline Editor - Mobile Selection and Contextual Actions
hide empty description
[*] --> NoSelection

NoSelection --> ClipSelected : tap clip
NoSelection --> TrackSelected : tap track header
ClipSelected --> ClipActions : resolve clip capabilities
TrackSelected --> TrackActions : resolve track capabilities

ClipActions --> ClipSelected : trim / split / duplicate / delete / properties
TrackActions --> TrackSelected : mute / rename / reorder / add track
ClipSelected --> NoSelection : clear selection
TrackSelected --> NoSelection : clear selection

state ClipSelected {
  [*] --> ClipToolbar
  state "Contextual clip actions" as ClipToolbar
}
state TrackSelected {
  [*] --> TrackToolbar
  state "Contextual track actions" as TrackToolbar
}

note right of NoSelection
Bottom action bar shows timeline-level actions.
Module navigation is separate and does not become
Storyboard / Timeline / Asset / Reference edit controls.
end note
note right of ClipActions
Action bar is derived from selected entity capabilities.
end note
@enduml
